"It is the System's phone network for a planet, reached by a very long number."
"It greets callers as Earthling and asks unregistered ones for name, reason and urgency."
"It warns that prank calls will be penalized."
"An Avowed's priority contacts are patched through when the Avowed is not on a quest."
"A call can be video, audio only, or empathetic telepathy."
"A caller gets a silver sigil on any phone held, even a rotary, and it cannot be deleted."
"Pressing the sigil and speaking gives commands, such as playing voicemails or calling."
"It keeps voicemail and offers to play a message again."
"On a call to one person, other people's words nearby are not sent."
"An Avowed sees call notices colored by the priority the Avowed assigned."
